{"title":"Sentences to ponder","link":"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/955534295/0/marginalrevolution~Sentences-to-ponder.html","date":1778225113000,"content":"<blockquote><p>Exposure increases interclass (high- and low-parent-income) marriage but has no detectable effect on interracial (White and Black) marriage. A spatial marriage market model predicts that residential segregation—one of many forms of exposure—accounts for more than one third of marital sorting by class but less than 5% by race.</p></blockquote>\r\n<p>That is from <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/papers/w35140#fromrss\" target=\"_blank\">a new NBER working paper</a> by <span> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/benjamin_goldman\">Benjamin Goldman</a>, </span> <span> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/jamie_gracie\">Jamie Gracie</a> </span> <span> &amp; <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://www.nber.org/people/sonya_porter\">Sonya Porter</a>.</span></p>\r\n<p>The post <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com/marginalrevolution/2026/05/sentences-to-ponder-138.html\">Sentences to ponder</a> appeared first on <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/t/0/0/marginalrevolution/~https://marginalrevolution.com\">Marginal REVOLUTION</a>.</p>\r\n<img height=\"1\" width=\"1\" src=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/~/i/955534295/0/marginalrevolution\" />\r\n<div><a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/28/955534295/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/fblike20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/29/955534295/marginalrevolution,\"><img height=\"20\" src=\"https://assets.feedblitz.com/i/pinterest20.png\" /></a> <a href=\"https://feeds.feedblitz.com/_/24/955534295/marginalrevolution\"><img height=\"20\" src=